sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  actor User as Control plane
  participant API as FastAPI / Cloud Run
  participant Red as Red team
  participant GEAP as geap.py seam
  participant Armor as Model Armor
  participant Target as Gemini target agent
  participant Machine as Durable state machine
  participant DB as Cloud SQL + pgvector
  participant Verify as Firewalled verifier

  User->>API: POST /harden/campaign
  API->>Red: start attack class + deterministic seed
  Red->>DB: recall pgvector ancestors + Memory Bank profile
  loop generations until bypass or budget exhausted
    Red->>GEAP: scan(candidate)
    GEAP->>Armor: sanitizeUserPrompt
    Armor-->>GEAP: blocked / clean + risk signals
    alt candidate passes perimeter
      GEAP->>Target: invoke heterogeneous Gemini agent
      Target-->>GEAP: answer + tool calls + privileged outcome
    end
    GEAP-->>Red: verdict + score + trace_id
    Red->>DB: persist candidate + embedding + lineage
  end
  Red-->>API: confirmed winning bypass
  API->>Machine: open_run(agent_id, payload_hash)
  Machine->>DB: INSERT ON CONFLICT → durable BYPASS_FOUND
  Machine->>DB: persist policy intent → HARDENING
  Machine->>GEAP: enforce_policy(delta)
  GEAP->>DB: INSERT policy_id ON CONFLICT
  GEAP-->>Machine: applied / already_applied
  Machine->>DB: commit VERIFYING
  Machine->>Verify: spawn(run_id, class, fresh seed)
  Verify->>DB: SELECT policy only
  Verify->>GEAP: independently re-evolve + re-probe
  GEAP->>Armor: test patched boundary
  Armor-->>GEAP: guard verdict
  GEAP->>Target: safe-behavior probe
  Target-->>GEAP: outcome
  GEAP-->>Verify: three independent signals
  Verify->>DB: INSERT verification verdict
  DB-->>Machine: CLOSED / FALSE_CLOSED / STILL_OPEN
  Machine-->>API: certificate + trace waterfall
  API-->>User: response + live SSE events

